 "slides": [
  {
   "slide": 1,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 0,
     "end": 9.815,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s01k0l01",
       "start": 0,
       "end": 5.274,
       "text": "Every spring, beekeepers lift a lid... and find a silent hive."
      },
      {
       "id": "s01k0l02",
       "start": 5.564,
       "end": 8.421,
       "text": "We think that hive was telling them for weeks."
      },
      {
       "id": "s01k0l03",
       "start": 8.571,
       "end": 9.815,
       "text": "Nobody was listening."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 10.155,
     "end": 21.046,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s01k1l01",
       "start": 10.155,
       "end": 14.249,
       "text": "Quick note. Hivewise is made up, and so is, uh, every number here."
      },
      {
       "id": "s01k1l02",
       "start": 14.419,
       "end": 16.124,
       "text": "The dots still work like a real deck."
      },
      {
       "id": "s01k1l03",
       "start": 16.264,
       "end": 21.046,
       "text": "Solid is measured, half is inferred, dashed is a guess."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 2,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 21.271,
     "end": 21.271,
     "lines": []
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 21.496,
     "end": 29.447,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s02k1l01",
       "start": 21.496,
       "end": 26.093,
       "text": "Last winter our pilot beekeepers lost thirty-eight percent of their colonies."
      },
      {
       "id": "s02k1l02",
       "start": 26.303,
       "end": 29.447,
       "text": "Varroa mites. A failed queen. A cold snap."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 2,
     "start": 29.717,
     "end": 33.935,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s02k2l01",
       "start": 29.717,
       "end": 32.322,
       "text": "And most of those losses were found in spring."
      },
      {
       "id": "s02k2l02",
       "start": 32.462,
       "end": 33.935,
       "text": "Too late to do anything."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 3,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 34.435,
     "end": 36.005,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s03k0l01",
       "start": 34.435,
       "end": 36.005,
       "text": "Here is the insight."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 36.215,
     "end": 42.125,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s03k1l01",
       "start": 36.215,
       "end": 42.125,
       "text": "A healthy colony hums. Steady, low, almost, almost boring."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 2,
     "start": 42.335,
     "end": 47.077,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s03k2l01",
       "start": 42.335,
       "end": 44.521,
       "text": "A queenless colony roars."
      },
      {
       "id": "s03k2l02",
       "start": 44.661,
       "end": 47.077,
       "text": "The pitch climbs, and it gets ragged."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 3,
     "start": 47.347,
     "end": 55.036,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s03k3l01",
       "start": 47.347,
       "end": 52.356,
       "text": "We hear that change about three weeks before a beekeeper would see it."
      },
      {
       "id": "s03k3l02",
       "start": 52.506,
       "end": 55.036,
       "text": "That number is inferred, from forty hives."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 4,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 55.516,
     "end": 57.698,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s04k0l01",
       "start": 55.516,
       "end": 57.698,
       "text": "So we built the ear."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 57.908,
     "end": 61.557,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s04k1l01",
       "start": 57.908,
       "end": 61.557,
       "text": "A small sensor sits under the lid and listens all day."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 2,
     "start": 61.767,
     "end": 67.015,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s04k2l01",
       "start": 61.767,
       "end": 63.926,
       "text": "A tiny model on the device scores the sound..."
      },
      {
       "id": "s04k2l02",
       "start": 64.046,
       "end": 67.015,
       "text": "so it runs for a year on one battery."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 3,
     "start": 67.285,
     "end": 70.845,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s04k3l01",
       "start": 67.285,
       "end": 70.845,
       "text": "When something changes, your phone tells you which hive, and what to check."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 5,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 71.095,
     "end": 71.095,
     "lines": []
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 71.345,
     "end": 77.886,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s05k1l01",
       "start": 71.345,
       "end": 73.731,
       "text": "We started in January with forty hives."
      },
      {
       "id": "s05k1l02",
       "start": 73.881,
       "end": 77.886,
       "text": "Today it's one thousand two hundred and forty. All through word of mouth."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 2,
     "start": 78.156,
     "end": 84.916,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s05k2l01",
       "start": 78.156,
       "end": 81.88,
       "text": "The dashed line is our guess for December. Six thousand hives."
      },
      {
       "id": "s05k2l02",
       "start": 82.05,
       "end": 84.916,
       "text": "It's a guess, and I'll, I'll say so every time."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 6,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 85.166,
     "end": 85.166,
     "lines": []
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 85.416,
     "end": 88.889,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s06k1l01",
       "start": 85.416,
       "end": 88.889,
       "text": "The model is simple. Nine dollars a hive, a month."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 2,
     "start": 89.159,
     "end": 98.261,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s06k2l01",
       "start": 89.159,
       "end": 91.615,
       "text": "A hundred and twelve beekeepers pay us today."
      },
      {
       "id": "s06k2l02",
       "start": 91.765,
       "end": 94.664,
       "text": "We think the margin is about seventy-one percent."
      },
      {
       "id": "s06k2l03",
       "start": 94.804,
       "end": 98.261,
       "text": "Payback in five months is, um, still a guess."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slide": 7,
   "segments": [
    {
     "k": 0,
     "start": 98.761,
     "end": 100.438,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s07k0l01",
       "start": 98.761,
       "end": 100.438,
       "text": "So here is the ask."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": 1,
     "start": 100.648,
     "end": 115.38,
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "s07k1l01",
       "start": 100.648,
       "end": 103.45,
       "text": "We're raising one point two million dollars."
      },
      {
       "id": "s07k1l02",
       "start": 103.6,
       "end": 108.312,
       "text": "Almost half goes into sensors, a third into the team, the rest into sales."
      },
      {
       "id": "s07k1l03",
       "start": 108.492,
       "end": 112.451,
       "text": "That buys eighteen months, and ten thousand hives listening."
      },
      {
       "id": "s07k1l04",
       "start": 112.901,
       "end": 115.38,
       "text": "Thank you. I'd love your questions."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}